      "source": [
        "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
        "shap.summary_plot(shap_values_to_plot, X_test_landslide2, plot_type=\"bar\", show=False)\n",
        "plt.title('SHAP Bar Plot of Feature Importance')\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
        "shap.summary_plot(shap_values_to_plot, X_test_landslide2, show=False)\n",
        "plt.title('SHAP Summary Plot (Feature Impact and Direction)')\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()\n",
        "print(\"SHAP Summary Plots generated.\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "babd9c4d"
      },
      "source": [
        "#### Local Prediction Explanations (SHAP Force Plot)\n",
        "\n",
        "Force plots visualize the contribution of each feature for a single prediction. They show how features push the prediction from the base value (average prediction) to the model's output for that specific instance. We will demonstrate a few examples."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
